Yet another wish for future versions.

How about after the endgame you get to try and replace the god or goddess
of your character?   You get another couple of nasty puzzles to unravel
while you try and rise through the ranks of the heavens, until you finally
get to challenge the Big Cheese.

E.g., your valkyrie Hotstuff unseats Loki and future games with valkyries
will see chaotic alters to Hotstuff instead of Loki.

I'm thinking these puzzles should maybe be more of the intellectual variety
than hack and slash: like mastermind, riddles with god-awful puns as the 
answer, nasty mazes....

Of course, fail to solve one puzzle and your gone, gods have to be
omniscient.

